				<r3d:description language="eng">The Radboud Data Repository (RDR) is an institutional repository that supports Radboud University and Radboudumc (Nijmegen, the Netherlands) researchers in archiving and sharing collected, processed, or analyzed data. The repository allows safe long-term (at least 10 years) storage of large datasets. The RDR promotes findability of datasets by providing a DOI and rich metadata fields and allows researchers to easily manage data access.</r3d:description>
